// Minimap overview material (2026-08-02): without this the custom map's
// minimap background renders WHITE/grey and the hero dots float on nothing.
// Compiled by scripts/vm-buildmap.ps1 (resourcecompiler); the texture is
// regenerated from arena.json by mapgen/genoverview.py in the same step.
//
// Run 36 forensics: the texture param is "Texture" — NOT "TextureColor".
// With an unknown param the compiler silently binds materials/default/
// default_tga (solid grey) and reports OK. Template: Valve's own conquest
// addon, content/dota_addons/conquest/materials/overviews/cp_forest.vmat.
"Layer0"
{
	"Shader"	"ui.vfx"
	"F_TRANSLUCENT"	"0"
	"Texture"	"materials/overviews/pudge_wars.png"
}
